# UI Development

Match nearby layouts, spacing, typography, and loading/empty/error states.

## Pages

- Public page class owns `Scaffold` and `AppBar`; body in private `_FeaturePage` child.
- `@RoutePage()` for auto_route pages. See `.cursor/templates/page-template.dart`.
- Page-scoped blocs: `BlocProvider(create: (_) => coreSl<FeatureBloc>(), …)` — never nullable `_bloc`, manual `close()`, or null checks in `build`. See `.cursor/references/architecture/codegen-and-di.md`.
- Feature-flagged auth routes: `guardUserAccountsRoute(context)` in `initState`; still create the bloc via `BlocProvider`.

## Constants and theme

- Spacing: `packages/ui_kit/lib/src/constants/spacing_constants.dart`
- Borders: `packages/ui_kit/lib/src/constants/border_constants.dart`
- Also check `ui_constants.dart`, theme extensions, app colors before adding values.

## Copy and localization

- User-facing strings: `lib/i18n/*.i18n.json` + `context.t` — see `.cursor/references/architecture/i18n.md`.
- Core error/success strings: `localizeCoreMessage(context, message)` at the presentation boundary.

## Widgets

- Feature widgets under the feature's `widgets/` folder.
- Use `part`/`part of` only where the feature already does; keep `part` declarations alphabetical.

## Widget tests

- Test user-visible behavior; use existing widget/product-tour keys where relevant.
